<title>GERMANY: Frankfurt dollar fix 1.8310 marks.</title>
<headline>Frankfurt dollar fix 1.8310 marks.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The dollar was fixed at 1.8310 marks in Frankfurt on Wednesday, after 1.8126 marks on Tuesday. There was no Bundesbank intervention. REUTER</p>
</text>
